Its reservation software is built to help property managers maximise availability and manage release dates as part of a wider yield-management strategy, with the broader platform offering real-time updating of ledger balances and account reconciliations. The system is designed to be customised to suit a specific property''s needs rather than applied as a rigid, one-size package. Based in Erasmusrand, Pretoria, PAN Hospitality suits hotels and other hospitality businesses wanting their reservations, stock, accounting and room management handled through one integrated system.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.panhospitality.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'pan-hospitality-pty-ltd-erasmusrand' AND description = 'PAN Hospitality, founded in 1998 and based in Erasmusrand, develops a hospitality property management software system covering reservations and front-of-house, stock and point-of-sale, accounting and payroll, room management, and debtors and creditors.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
